"``SOCIAL_AUTH_GITHUB_ORG_*`` e ``SOCIAL_AUTH_GITHUB_TEAM_*``, e requerem "
"configuração adicional do escopo -- ``SOCIAL_AUTH_GITHUB_ORG_NAME`` ou "
"``SOCIAL_AUTH_GITHUB_TEAM_ID``. Seus URLs de retorno de chamada são "
"``https://WEBLATE SERVER/accounts/complete/github-org/`` e ``https://WEBLATE "
"SERVER/accounts/complete/github-teams/``."

