"configurações: :setting:`django:EMAIL_HOST`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_USE_SSL`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_USE_TLS`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_HOST_USER` "
