"Zero-width space (<U+200B>) characters are used to break messages within "
"words (word wrapping)."
msgstr ""
"Os caracteres de largura zero (<U+200B>) são usados para quebrar mensagens "
"dentro das palavras (*word wrapping*)."

msgid ""
"As they are usually inserted by mistake, this check is triggered once they "
"are present in translation. Some programs might have problems when this "
"character is used."
msgstr ""
"Como geralmente são inseridas por engano, esta verificação é acionada uma "
